  "passage": "Dear Diary, Yesterday was the annual school sports day, and it was so much fun! I participated in the running race, and although I didn't win, it was a pleasure to cheer for my friends. The traffic to the stadium was busy in the morning, but we arrived on time. During lunch, we had a big dinner at school – I mean, it was more like a late lunch, but they called it dinner. It was obvious that everyone was tired after all the activities. I saw a small creature, like a hedgehog, near the field, which was exciting. Thinking about the environment, I'm glad our school promotes recycling. Also, I've been watching my weight lately because I want to stay fit for next year's sports day. It was a memorable day, and I'm already looking forward to the next annual event. From, Sam",
